WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.734
-Good evening.

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:02.768
I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.768 --> 00:00:04.237
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:05.905
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:07.573
President Biden
announced yesterday

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:10.777
that his administration
will lower the cost of insulin

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:13.813
for everyone, regardless
of their Medicare status.

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:15.915
And not a moment too soon.

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:17.450
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:22.021
We didn't make that.
That's an actual product.

00:00:22.021 --> 00:00:24.323
During the same event
at the White House yesterday,

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:25.925
President Biden
pulled out a copy

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:29.795
of Florida senator Rick Scott's
12-point plan to rescue America

00:00:29.795 --> 00:00:32.865
and said that it could end
Social Security and Medicare.

00:00:32.865 --> 00:00:35.468
Oh, that'll be popular
in Florida.

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:36.268
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.268 --> 00:00:37.770
What's his next idea?

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:41.541
Abolishing visits
from grandkids?

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.742
According to a new book,
former president Trump

00:00:43.742 --> 00:00:47.413
would tell White House visitors
that he had a secret bathroom.

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:51.150
And visitors would tell him,
"Sir, that's just a closet."

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.986
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.525
[ As Trump ]
That's part of the secret.

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:00.426
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.426 --> 00:01:02.795
[ Normal voice ] The book
also claims that while meeting

00:01:02.795 --> 00:01:05.798
then-president Barack Obama
in 2016 after being elected,

00:01:05.798 --> 00:01:07.734
former president Trump
asked Obama

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:10.536
how he kept his approval ratings
so high.

00:01:10.536 --> 00:01:12.572
"What'd he say," asked Biden.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.506
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.506 --> 00:01:17.176
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell said yesterday

00:01:17.176 --> 00:01:19.279
that he will support
the bipartisan bill

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:22.782
to reform the
Electoral Count Act of 1887.

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:26.119
I guess he still feels bad
after voting no the first time.

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:28.053
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.053 --> 00:01:32.558
Britain's Prince George
reportedly told his classmates,

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:35.428
"My dad will be king,
so you better watch out."

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:36.595
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.595 --> 00:01:38.131
Which, you have to admit,

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:41.934
is a crushing comeback
for a 9-year-old.

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:43.302
"Tag, you're it."

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:46.906
"If by it you mean
the once and future king!"

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:52.712
New York mayor Eric Adams
announced yesterday

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:54.581
that he will launch
a chess council

00:01:54.581 --> 00:01:56.816
to develop more
plant-based recipes

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:58.217
for public school lunches.

00:01:58.217 --> 00:02:00.153
Meanwhile, most of
the high school students

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:03.022
will continue to enjoy
plant-based recess.

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:04.991
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.126 --> 00:02:09.562
And finally, after receiving
criticism from viewers,

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:12.999
Netflix removed the LGBTQ tag
from its new series

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:14.767
about serial killer
Jeffrey Dahmer.

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:18.304
On the downside, they left
the food and travel tag.

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:20.406
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:26.145
And that was the monologue.

00:02:26.145 --> 00:02:28.547
I don't know why --
You know, but...

00:02:28.547 --> 00:02:30.750
You don't pick
the ones you end on.

